{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_19","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"set -o pipefail\nbase='https://iccmrt.ac.in'\npaths=(/about-us/ /contact-us/ /education/ /admissions/ /mba-programme/ /bba/ /bcom/ /training-2/ /training/ /ado-adco-training/ /acabc-training/ /rpto/ /admission-open/ /rptu-tsu-programs/ /skill-development-programmee/ /certificate-courses-of-tribhuvan-sahkari-university/ /drone-training-registration/ /training-officers/)\nfor path in \\\"\"'${paths[@]}\"; do\n  slug=$(printf '\"'%s' \\\"\"'$path\" | tr -cd '\"'[:alnum:]-' | sed 's/\"'^-*//'\"')\n  raw=\\\"\"'${TMPDIR:-$PWD}/iccmrt-page-${slug}-$$.html\"\n  txt=\"${TMPDIR:-$PWD}/iccmrt-page-${slug}-$$.txt\"\n  echo \"=== $path ===\"\n  if curl -k -L --fail --silent --show-error --max-time 30 -A '\"'Mozilla/5.0' \\\"\"'$base$path\" > \"$raw\"; then\n    pandoc -f html -t plain --wrap=none \"$raw\" 2>/dev/null | sed '\"'s/[[:space:]]\\\\+\"'$//'\"' | sed '/\"'^[[:space:]]*$/d'\"' | head -160\n  else\n    echo 'REQUEST_FAILED'\n  fi\n  rm -f \\\"\"'$raw\" \"$txt\"\n  echo\n done'","aggregated_output":"=== /about-us/ ===\ninfo@iccmrt.ac.in | 0522-2716092\nOnline Payment Employee Login Enquiry\nAdmission Open 2026-27\n[Shri Narendra Modi]\nShri Narendra Modi\nHon'ble Prime Minister\nGovernment of India\n[Shri Amit Shah]\nShri Amit Shah\nMinister of Home Affairs\nGovernment of India\n[logo]\n[Yogi Adityanath]\nYogi Adityanath\nHon'ble Chief Minister\nUttar Pradesh\n[Shri JPS Rathore]\nShri JPS Rathore\nHon'ble Minister of State\n(Independent Charge)\nCo-Operative Govt. of U.P.\n- \n- About Us\n  - Overview\n  - Vision & Mission\n  - Management Committee\n  - Core Activities\n    - Education\n    - Research & Consultancy\n    - Training\n- Admissions\n  - Admissions\n  - MBA\n  - BBA\n  - B.Com (Hons)\n- Placement\n  - Placement\n  - Placement Cell\n- Faculty\n- Infrastructure\n- Training\n  - ADO/ ADCO Training\n  - ACABC Training\n  - Drone Remote Pilot Training\n- Gallery\n- Contact Us\nLATEST NEWS ^(New!)Students Interested in taking MBA/BBA Admission at ICCMRT, Lucknow through spot counselling may register at AKTU portal. Last Date 14.09.2026 || ^(New!)Admission Open for MBA/BBA/B.Com(Hons) 2026-27 || ^(New!)Certificate Courses of Tribhuvan Sahkari University || ^(New!)Drone Training Registration || ^(New!)Training for Officers/Employers ||\nAbout Us\nHome / About Us\nThe Institute of Co-operative and Corporate Management, Research and Training (ICCMRT) is one of the premier institutes of higher education in Uttar Pradesh. It was established by the Government of Uttar Pradesh in 1978 to promote quality education, research, consultancy and training.\nThe Institute has established as an identity of its own and serves as a locus of management education, computer training, research and consultancy. It has now diversified its activities in pursuit of its objectives to inculcate professionalism in the corporate world. Since 2001, the institute has successfully groomed 25 batches of young professionals through its MBA programme and welcomes the aspirants to the current 26^(th) Batch.\nThe pedagogy of the MBA programme consists of class room lectures, management games, case study discussions, brain storming sessions, industrial visits, seminars, conferences and EDPs. The Institute has been taking conscious efforts to bring reputed companies to conduct campus placement drives. The highest package of our student placement last year was Rs.12.00 Lakh per annum (RSH Group, Google Accenture, and ITC) and the average package was Rs. 6.00 Lakh per annum.\nThe Institute also offers Lucknow University affiliated undergraduate programmes BBA and B.Com (Hons.) from the year 2018 onwards. This year the Institute is also introducing one more stream of BBA programme affiliated to AKTU, Lucknow.\nAdditionally, the Institute is expanding its academic reach by taking the Programme Affiliation of Tribhuvan Sahkari University (TSU), Gujarat, the first ever Cooperative University of the nation. The Institute will start the TSU affiliated Degree Programmes (UG and PG) and various Certificate Programmes from the year 2026-27 onwards.\nICCMRT welcomes you all to be a part of this prestigious family.\nWish you all the very best.\nContact Us\n467, Sector-21, Institutional Area, Ring Road, Indira Nagar LUCKNOW-226016\n0522-2716092\n7355615114, 9919360380\ninfo@iccmrt.ac.in\nOur Programme\n- MBA\n- BBA\n- B.Com (Hons)\nAcademics\n- Admissions\n- Faculty\n- Online Payment\n- Training\n- Contact Us\nImportant Links\n- AKTU University\n- Lucknow University\n- TSU\n- AICTE\n- UPESSC\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n© 2026 ICCMRT Lucknow.All Rights Reserved.\nInquiry Form\nQuick Enquiry\nSelect Course MBA BBA B.Com (Hons.)\nSubmit\n\n=== /contact-us/ ===\ninfo@iccmrt.ac.in | 0522-2716092\nOnline Payment Employee Login Enquiry\nAdmission Open 2026-27\n[Shri Narendra Modi]\nShri Narendra Modi\nHon'ble Prime Minister\nGovernment of India\n[Shri Amit Shah]\nShri Amit Shah\nMinister of Home Affairs\nGovernment of India\n[logo]\n[Yogi Adityanath]\nYogi Adityanath\nHon'ble Chief Minister\nUttar Pradesh\n[Shri JPS Rathore]\nShri JPS Rathore\nHon'ble Minister of State\n(Independent Charge)\nCo-Operative Govt. of U.P.\n- \n- About Us\n  - Overview\n  - Vision & Mission\n  - Management Committee\n  - Core Activities\n    - Education\n    - Research & Consultancy\n    - Training\n- Admissions\n  - Admissions\n  - MBA\n  - BBA\n  - B.Com (Hons)\n- Placement\n  - Placement\n  - Placement Cell\n- Faculty\n- Infrastructure\n- Training\n  - ADO/ ADCO Training\n  - ACABC Training\n  - Drone Remote Pilot Training\n- Gallery\n- Contact Us\nLATEST NEWS ^(New!)Students Interested in taking MBA/BBA Admission at ICCMRT, Lucknow through spot counselling may register at AKTU portal. Last Date 14.09.2026 || ^(New!)Admission Open for MBA/BBA/B.Com(Hons) 2026-27 || ^(New!)Certificate Courses of Tribhuvan Sahkari University || ^(New!)Drone Training Registration || ^(New!)Training for Officers/Employers ||\nContact Us\nHome / Contact Us\nInstitute of Co-operative and Corporate Management, Research & Training (ICCMRT) (Established by the Government of Uttar Pradesh)\n467, Sector-21, Institutional Area, Ring Road, Indira Nagar, Lucknow-226016 (U.P.)\nDirector: Mr. Rajeev Yadav\nDirector, ICCMRT / Additional Commissioner & Additional Registrar (Co) E-mail: director@iccmrt.ac.in, info@iccmrt.ac.in           \nMBA Principal: Dr. K. Anbumani\nE-mail: principal@iccmrt.ac.in, mpcell@iccmrt.ac.in           \nMob: 7355615114\nUG Principal: Dr. Manvendra Singh Parihar\nE-mail: principal@iccmrt.ac.in, info@iccmrt.ac.in           \nMob: 9559607629\nMBA Training & Placements\n1. Dr. Bhoomika Trehan Assistant Professor / TPO\nE-mail: placement@iccmrt.ac.in          \nMob: 8707334221\n2. Ms. Farhana Jamal Assistant Professor / TPO\nE-mail: placement@iccmrt.ac.in          \nMob: 9792351511\nTraining & Consultancy\n1. Dr. Ram Komal Prasad (ADO/ADCO and Other Trainings) Associate Professor\nE-mail: info@iccmrt.ac.in       \nMob: 9919360380\n2. Mr. Anjum Zia Rizvi (RPTO Training) Assistant Professor\nE-mail: info@iccmrt.ac.in         \nMob: 9559593312\nHostels\n1. Mr. Indrakesh Yadav (Asst. Hostel Warden – Boys) Assistant Professor\nMob: 7355008020\n2. Dr. Smita Verma (Asst. Hostel Warden – Girls) Assistant Professor\nMob: 9452101010\n*****\nContact Us\n467, Sector-21, Institutional Area, Ring Road, Indira Nagar LUCKNOW-226016\n0522-2716092\n7355615114, 9919360380\ninfo@iccmrt.ac.in\nOur Programme\n- MBA\n- BBA\n- B.Com (Hons)\nAcademics\n- Admissions\n- Faculty\n- Online Payment\n- Training\n- Contact Us\nImportant Links\n- AKTU University\n- Lucknow University\n- TSU\n- AICTE\n- UPESSC\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n© 2026 ICCMRT Lucknow.All Rights Reserved.\nInquiry Form\nQuick Enquiry\nSelect Course MBA BBA B.Com (Hons.)\nSubmit\n\n=== /education/ ===\ni