n approval from the AICTE, New Delhi to introduce 3 year full time BBA affiliated to Dr. APJ Abdul Kalam Technical University (AKTU), Lucknow with an annual intake of 60 seats.\n(ii). LU Affiliated Programmes\n1.  Bachelor of Commerce (Honors): From the year 2018-19 onwards, the Institute has been offering UGC approved 3 year full time undergraduate programme B.Com (H) affiliated to the University of Lucknow with an annual intake of 60 seats. Six batches have been successfully passed out till now.\n2.  Bachelor of Business Administration: From the year 2018-19 onwards, the Institute has been offering UGC approved 3 year full time undergraduate programme BBA affiliated to the University of Lucknow with an annual intake of 60 seats. Six batches have been successfully passed out till now.\n(iii). TSU Affiliated Programmes\n1. Degree Programmes: The Institute has obtained Programmes Affiliation from the Tribhuvan Sahkari University (TSU), Gujarat to conduct three long-term degree programmes namely,\n1. MBA (Agri-Business Management),\n2. MBA (Cooperative Management) and\n3. BBA (Cooperative Banking and Finance)\nfrom the academic year 2026-27 onwards with and annual intake of 60 each.\n2. Certificate Programmes: The Institute has also obtained Programmes Affiliation from the Tribhuvan Sahkari University (TSU), Gujarat to conduct five short-term certificate programmes namely,\n1.  Higher Diploma in Cooperative Management,\n2. Certificate Course in Accounts and Finance for PACS Secretaries and Accountants,\n3. Certificate Course in Accounts and Finance for DCB Branch Managers and Accountants,\n4. Certificate Course in Accounts and Finance for LDB Branch Managers and  Accountants and\n5.  Certificate Course in Cooperative Accounts and Auditing from the academic year 2026-27 onwards with a batch intake of 30 each.\nContact Us\n467, Sector-21, Institutional Area, Ring Road, Indira Nagar LUCKNOW-226016\n0522-2716092\n7355615114, 9919360380\ninfo@iccmrt.ac.in\nOur Programme\n- MBA\n- BBA\n- B.Com (Hons)\nAcademics\n- Admissions\n- Faculty\n- Online Payment\n- Training\n- Contact Us\nImportant Links\n- AKTU University\n- Lucknow University\n- TSU\n- AICTE\n- UPESSC\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n© 2026 ICCMRT Lucknow.All Rights Reserved.\nInquiry Form\nQuick Enquiry\nSelect Course MBA BBA B.Com (Hons.)\nSubmit\n\n=== /admissions/ ===\ninfo@iccmrt.ac.in | 0522-2716092\nOnline Payment Employee Login Enquiry\nAdmission Open 2026-27\n[Shri Narendra Modi]\nShri Narendra Modi\nHon'ble Prime Minister\nGovernment of India\n[Shri Amit Shah]\nShri Amit Shah\nMinister of Home Affairs\nGovernment of India\n[logo]\n[Yogi Adityanath]\nYogi Adityanath\nHon'ble Chief Minister\nUttar Pradesh\n[Shri JPS Rathore]\nShri JPS Rathore\nHon'ble Minister of State\n(Independent Charge)\nCo-Operative Govt. of U.P.\n- \n- About Us\n  - Overview\n  - Vision & Mission\n  - Management Committee\n  - Core Activities\n    - Education\n    - Research & Consultancy\n    - Training\n- Admissions\n  - Admissions\n  - MBA\n  - BBA\n  - B.Com (Hons)\n- Placement\n  - Placement\n  - Placement Cell\n- Faculty\n- Infrastructure\n- Training\n  - ADO/ ADCO Training\n  - ACABC Training\n  - Drone Remote Pilot Training\n- Gallery\n- Contact Us\nLATEST NEWS ^(New!)Students Interested in taking MBA/BBA Admission at ICCMRT, Lucknow through spot counselling may register at AKTU portal. Last Date 14.09.2026 || ^(New!)Admission Open for MBA/BBA/B.Com(Hons) 2026-27 || ^(New!)Certificate Courses of Tribhuvan Sahkari University || ^(New!)Drone Training Registration || ^(New!)Training for Officers/Employers ||\nAdmissions\nHome / Admissions\nICCMRT strives to ensure a seamless and efficient admission process. Our committed team of experienced counsellors plays a crucial role in assisting students to select the right program, and they are readily available at the Institute to address any questions related to admissions. We understand that this decision profoundly impacts their life and future careers.\nAcademic Programme\nThe Institute offers academic programmes affiliated to 1. Dr. APJ Abul Kalam technical University (AKTU), Lucknow, 2. University of Lucknow (LU), and 3. Tribhuvan Sahkari University (TSU), Gujarat as listed below;\n(i). AKTU, Lucknow Affiliated Programmes\n1.  Master of Business Administration (MBA) – Approved Intake: 180\n2.  Bachelor of Business Administration (BBA) – Approved Intake: 60\n(ii). University of Lucknow Affiliated Programmes\n1.  Bachelor of Business Administration (BBA) – Approved Intake: 60\n2.  Bachelor of Commerce (Honors) (B.Com – Honors) – Approved Intake: 60\n(iii). TSU, Gujarat Affiliated Degree Programmes\n1.  Master of Business Administration – Agri-Business Management (MBA-ABM) – Approved Intake: 60\n2.  Master of Business Administration (Cooperative Management) – (MBA-Coop) – Approved Intake: 60\n3.  Bachelor of Business Administration (Cooperative Banking and Finance) – Approved Intake: 60\n(iv). TSU, Gujarat Affiliated Certificate Programmes\nThe Institute also conducts the following five short term Certificate Programmes Affiliated to the Tribhuvan Sahkari University (TSU), Gujarat. Approved Intake 30 in each programme;\n1. Higher Diploma in Cooperative Management,\n2. Certificate Course in Accounts and Finance for PACS Secretaries and Accountants,\n3. Certificate Course in Accounts and Finance for DCB Branch Managers and Accountants,\n4. Certificate Course in Accounts and Finance for LDB Branch Managers and Accountants\n5. Certificate Course in Cooperative Accounts and Auditing.\nContact Us\n467, Sector-21, Institutional Area, Ring Road, Indira Nagar LUCKNOW-226016\n0522-2716092\n7355615114, 9919360380\ninfo@iccmrt.ac.in\nOur Programme\n- MBA\n- BBA\n- B.Com (Hons)\nAcademics\n- Admissions\n- Faculty\n- Online Payment\n- Training\n- Contact Us\nImportant Links\n- AKTU University\n- Lucknow University\n- TSU\n- AICTE\n- UPESSC\n-------------------------------------