{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_20","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"set -o pipefail\nbase='https://iccmrt.ac.in'\nfor item in 'mba|/mba-programme/' 'bba|/bba/' 'bcom|/bcom/' 'edu|/education/' 'adm|/admissions/'; do\n  name=\"'${item%%|*}; path=${item#*|}\n  raw=\"${TMPDIR:-$PWD}/iccmrt-${name}-$$.html\"\n  txt=\"${TMPDIR:-$PWD}/iccmrt-${name}-$$.txt\"\n  curl -k -L --fail --silent --show-error --max-time 30 -A '\"'Mozilla/5.0' \\\"\"'$base$path\" > \"$raw\"\n  pandoc -f html -t plain --wrap=none \"$raw\" 2>/dev/null | sed '\"'s/[[:space:]]\\\\+\"'$//'\"' | sed '/\"'^[[:space:]]*$/d'\"' > \\\"\"'$txt\"\n  echo \"=== $path : COURSE / ELIGIBILITY / DURATION / AFFILIATION ===\"\n  rg -n -i -C 3 '\"'\"'^(MBA|BBA|B'\"\\\\.Com|Bachelor|Master|Higher Diploma|Certificate|Eligibility|Duration|Admission|Approved|Affiliated|Programme|Program)' \\\"\"'$txt\" | head -220\n  rm -f \"$raw\" \"$txt\"\n  echo\n done'","aggregated_output":"=== /mba-programme/ : COURSE / ELIGIBILITY / DURATION / AFFILIATION ===\n1-info@iccmrt.ac.in | 0522-2716092\n2-Online Payment Employee Login Enquiry\n3:Admission Open 2026-27\n4-[Shri Narendra Modi]\n5-Shri Narendra Modi\n6-Hon'ble Prime Minister\n--\n45-- Gallery\n46-- Contact Us\n47-LATEST NEWS ^(New!)Students Interested in taking MBA/BBA Admission at ICCMRT, Lucknow through spot counselling may register at AKTU portal. Last Date 14.09.2026 || ^(New!)Admission Open for MBA/BBA/B.Com(Hons) 2026-27 || ^(New!)Certificate Courses of Tribhuvan Sahkari University || ^(New!)Drone Training Registration || ^(New!)Training for Officers/Employers ||\n48:MBA Programme\n49-Home / MBA Programme\n50:MBA Admission (Intake: 180)\n51-Students are admitted to the 2 Year full- time MBA Programme approved by the AICTE, New Delhi and affiliated to Dr. APJ Abdul Kalam Technical University (AKTU), Lucknow through Common University Entrance Test (CUET-PG)  conducted by National Testing Agency (NTA) followed by AKTU Counselling.\n52-1.  NTA Link for CUET PG:  National Testing Agency\n53-2.  AKTU Link for MBA Counselling:  Create an Account – Uttar Pradesh Technical Admission Counselling (UPTAC)\n54-Tentative Date of AKTU Counselling:  1^(st) Week of July 2026\n55:Eligibility\n56-The candidate who have passed any Bachelor’s degree of minimum three years duration from any the recognized college / University of India as recognized by UGC with at least 50% marks (45% in case of candidates belonging to SC/ST category) in the qualifying examination are eligible to take MBA admission at ICCMRT.\n57-Reservation\n58-As per the norms of UP Government & AKTU, Lucknow.\n--\n82-- Students whose qualifying examination results have not been declared by the admission date, for any reason, will only be eligible for provisional admission.\n83-- Admitted students must submit all their original documents to MP Cell at the time of reporting. If any document is unavailable, they must submit the same within two months from the commencement of classes or at the time of AKTU Enrolment process, whichever is earlier. Failure to do so will result in the cancellation of their admission.\n84-Tentative Date of MBA Class Commencement:  2^(nd) Week of August 2026\n85:MBA Fees\n86-  Semester     Tuition Fee    Refundable Caution Deposit   University Examination fees   Total\n87-  ------------ -------------- ---------------------------- ----------------------------- --------------\n88-  Semester 1   Rs. 49385.00   Rs. 8000.00                  Rs. 7500.00                   Rs. 64885.00\n--\n97-5.  Booklets containing pay-in slips for this purpose shall be issued to the student during registration process. Duplicate fees booklet can be obtained from the MP Cell against written request along with a payment of Rs. 50.\n98-6.  Fees must be deposited latest by the due date declared by the Institute. Part payment of fees shall not be accepted. All dues must be cleared before obtaining admit card for end semester examinations.\n99-7.  Penalty will be charged at the rate of Rs.10/-per day for each day of late payment after the due date.\n100:MBA Specialization\n101-The MBA Programme offered by the Institute offers dual specialization. Students may choose any two of the following subjects as their specialization during the second year. Specialization subjects offered: 1. Marketing Management, 2. Financial Management, 3. Human Resources Management, 4. Information Technology, 5. International Business, 6. Operations Management and 7. Cooperative Management.\n102-Hostel Facility\n103-Separate hostels for boys and girls are available within the Institute’s premises. The annual hostel fees including mess charges is Rs. 67,000/- per year payable in two equal instalments semester wise (i.e., Rs. 33500 per semester). Also students availing hostel facility should pay a refundable caution deposit of Rs. 5000 which will be reimbursed after completion of the course (or) at the time of leaving the hostel whichever is earlier\n\n=== /bba/ : COURSE / ELIGIBILITY / DURATION / AFFILIATION ===\n1-info@iccmrt.ac.in | 0522-2716092\n2-Online Payment Employee Login Enquiry\n3:Admission Open 2026-27\n4-[Shri Narendra Modi]\n5-Shri Narendra Modi\n6-Hon'ble Prime Minister\n--\n45-- Gallery\n46-- Contact Us\n47-LATEST NEWS ^(New!)Students Interested in taking MBA/BBA Admission at ICCMRT, Lucknow through spot counselling may register at AKTU portal. Last Date 14.09.2026 || ^(New!)Admission Open for MBA/BBA/B.Com(Hons) 2026-27 || ^(New!)Certificate Courses of Tribhuvan Sahkari University || ^(New!)Drone Training Registration || ^(New!)Training for Officers/Employers ||\n48:BBA\n49-Home / BBA\n50:BBA Admission under LU (Intake: 60)\n51-The BBA programme is under the affiliation of Lucknow University under NEP-2020.\n52:Admission to 3 Year full- time BBA Programme (under NEP 2020) approved by the UGC and affiliated to the University of Lucknow (LU) is available in three modes namely;\n53-1.  LU Entrance Examination,\n54-2.  CUET-UG Examination and 3.  Direct Admission.\n55-1) Through LU Entrance\n--\n103-Note : \n104-- University examination fees has to be deposited by the students through online mode at university website.\n105-- The caution deposit is refundable to the students after their successful completion of the programme.\n106:BBA Admission under AKTU, Lucknow (Intake: 60)\n107:Admission to 3 Year full- time BBA Programme (under NEP 2020) approved by the AICTE, New Delhi and affiliated to Dr. APJ Abdul Kalam Technical University (AKTU), Lucknow is available in two modes namely;\n108-1.  CUET-UG Examination Followed by AKTU Counselling\n109-2.  Direct Admission\n110-1) Through AKTU Counselling\n--\n124-6.  High School Mark Sheet\n125-7.  ID Proof (Aadhaar / Bank Pass Book)\n126-8.  Four recent and identical Passport Size Photographs\n127:Eligibility\n128-The candidate who have passed 10 + 2 examination in any discipline, with at least 50% marks (45 % in case of candidate belonging to SC/ST category) in the qualifying examination are eligible to take BBA admission at ICCMRT\n129-Reservation\n130-As per the norms of UP Government & AKTU, Lucknow.\n131:BBA Fees\n132-The annual tuition fees for BBA is Rs. 60000 payable in two equal instalments semester wise. Students admitted in BBA programme also have to pay a refundable caution deposit of Rs. 8000 which will be reimbursed after their successful completion of the course.\n133-  -------------- -------------- ----------------- ---------------------- --------------\n134-  Semester       Tuition Fee    Caution Deposit   University Exam Fees   Total\n\n=== /bcom/ : COURSE / ELIGIBILITY / DURATION / AFFILIATION ===\n1-info@iccmrt.ac.in | 0522-2716092\n2-Online Payment Employee Login Enquiry\n3:Admission Open 2026-27\n4-[Shri Narendra Modi]\n5-Shri Narendra Modi\n6-Hon'ble Prime Minister\n--\n45-- Gallery\n46-- Contact Us\n47-LATEST NEWS ^(New!)Students Interested in taking MBA/BBA Admission at ICCMRT, Lucknow through spot counselling may register at AKTU portal. Last Date 14.09.2026 || ^(New!)Admission Open for MBA/BBA/B.Com(Hons) 2026-27 || ^(New!)Certificate Courses of Tribhuvan Sahkari University || ^(New!)Drone Training Registration || ^(New!)Training for Officers/Employers ||\n48:B.Com (Hons)\n49-Home / B.Com (Hons)\n50:B.Com (Honours) Admission (Intake: 60)\n51:Admission to 3 Year full- time B.Com (Honours) Programme (under NEP 2020) approved by the UGC and affiliated to the University of Lucknow (LU) is available in three modes namely;\n52-1.  LU Entrance Examination,\n53-2.  CUET-UG Examination\n54-3.  Direct Admission\n--\n78-6.  High School Mark Sheet\n79-7.  ID Proof (Aadhaar Card)\n80-8.  Four recent and identical Passport Size Photographs\n81:Eligibility\n82-The candidate who have passed 10 + 2 examination in any discipline, with at least 60% marks (55 % in case of candidate belonging to SC/ST category) in the qualifying examination are eligible to take B.Com (Honours) admission at ICCMRT. Also, the student must have studied Commerce (or) Economics (or) Mathematics as one of the subjects at the intermediate level.\n83-Reservation\n84-As per the norms of UP Government & University of Lucknow.\n85:B.Com (Honours) Fees\n86-  ------------ ------------- ----------------- ---------------------- -----------\n87-  Semester     Tuition Fee   Caution Deposit   University Exam Fees   Total\n88-  Semester 1   Rs. 30000     Rs. 8000          Rs. 1750               Rs. 39750\n\n=== /education/ : COURSE / ELIGIBILITY / DURATION / AFFILIATION ===\n1-info@iccmrt.ac.in | 0522-2716092\n2-Online Payment Employee Login Enquiry\n3:Admission Open 2026-27\n4-[Shri Narendra Modi]\n5-Shri Narendra Modi\n6-Hon'ble Prime Minister\n\n=== /admissions/ : COURSE / ELIGIBILITY / DURATION / AFFILIATION ===\n1-info@iccmrt.ac.in | 0522-2716092\n2-Online Payment Employee Login Enquiry\n3:Admission Open 2026-27\n4-[Shri Narendra Modi]\n5-Shri Narendra Modi\n6-Hon'ble Prime Minister\n--\n45-- Gallery\n46-- Contact Us\n47-LATEST NEWS ^(New!)Students Interested in taking MBA/BBA Admission at ICCMRT, Lucknow through spot counselling may register at AKTU portal. Last Date 14.09.2026 || ^(New!)Admission Open for MBA/BBA/B.Com(Hons) 2026-27 || ^(New!)Certificate Courses of Tribhuvan Sahkari University || ^(New!)Drone Training Registration || ^(New!)Training for Officers/Employers ||\n48:Admissions\n49-Home / Admissions\n50-ICCMRT strives to ensure a seamless and efficient admission process. Our committed team of experienced counsellors plays a crucial role in assisting students to select the right program, and they are readily available at the Institute to address any questions related to admissions. We understand that this decision profoundly impacts their life and future careers.\n51-Academic Programme\n\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
